@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam dpi 120
scale max 2800 width
hide empty members
left to right direction
title SkyCrop - Diagnoses Generation - Layered Class Design
package "Interfaces / Presentation" as interfacesLayer {
class DiagnosisController <<controller>> {
-service: IDiagnosisApplicationService
+generate(request: GenerateDiagnosisRequest): DiagnosisResource
+getById(id: Long): DiagnosisResource
}
class GenerateDiagnosisRequest <<request>> {
-plotId: Long
-imageIds: List<Long>
}
class DiagnosisResource <<resource>> {
-id: Long
}
class DiagnosisResourceAssembler <<assembler>> {
+toResource(entity: Diagnosis): DiagnosisResource
}
}
package "Application" as applicationLayer {
class GenerateDiagnosisCommand <<command>> {
-plotId: Long
-imageIds: List<Long>
}
interface IDiagnosisApplicationService {
+generate(command: GenerateDiagnosisCommand): DiagnosisResource
+getById(id: Long): DiagnosisResource
}
class DiagnosisApplicationService <<application service>> {
-repository: IDiagnosisRepository
+generate(command: GenerateDiagnosisCommand): DiagnosisResource
+getById(id: Long): DiagnosisResource
}
}
package "Domain" as domainLayer {
class Diagnosis <<aggregate root>> {
-id: Long
-generatedAt: Timestamp
-status: DiagnosisStatus
+generate(): void
}
interface IDiagnosisRepository <<repository contract>> {
+findById(id: Long): Diagnosis [0..1]
+save(entity: Diagnosis): void
}
}
package "Infrastructure" as infrastructureLayer {
class DiagnosisRepository <<repository>> {
-dbContext: SkyCropDbContext
+findById(id: Long): Diagnosis [0..1]
+save(entity: Diagnosis): void
}
class SkyCropDbContext <<EF Core>> {
+saveChanges(): int
}
}
DiagnosisController --> IDiagnosisApplicationService : delegates
DiagnosisController ..> GenerateDiagnosisRequest : receives
DiagnosisController ..> GenerateDiagnosisCommand : builds
DiagnosisController ..> DiagnosisResource : responds
DiagnosisApplicationService ..|> IDiagnosisApplicationService
IDiagnosisApplicationService ..> GenerateDiagnosisCommand : receives
DiagnosisApplicationService --> IDiagnosisRepository : queries and persists
DiagnosisApplicationService ..> Diagnosis : executes operations
DiagnosisApplicationService ..> DiagnosisResourceAssembler : transforms
DiagnosisResourceAssembler ..> Diagnosis : reads
DiagnosisResourceAssembler ..> DiagnosisResource : produces
DiagnosisRepository ..|> IDiagnosisRepository
IDiagnosisRepository ..> Diagnosis : persistence contract
DiagnosisRepository --> SkyCropDbContext : data access
package "Application" as applicationLayer {
interface IImageAnalysis <<integration contract>> {
+analyze(imageIds: List<Long>): String
}
}
package "Infrastructure" as infrastructureLayer {
class ImageAnalysisAdapter <<adapter>> {
+analyze(imageIds: List<Long>): String
}
}
DiagnosisApplicationService --> IImageAnalysis : requests an operation
ImageAnalysisAdapter ..|> IImageAnalysis
note bottom of ImageAnalysisAdapter
Analyzes the referenced images and returns results.
end note
DiagnosisController -[hidden]down-> DiagnosisApplicationService
DiagnosisApplicationService -[hidden]down-> Diagnosis
Diagnosis -[hidden]down-> DiagnosisRepository
legend bottom
Proposed class architecture for the backend RESTful API.
The view shows a context use case and retrieval by identifier.
Aggregate attributes are detailed in the domain views.
Infrastructure dependencies implement internal contracts.
endlegend
package "Domain" as domainLayer {
class TerrainData <<entity>> {
-id: Long
-pH: PhLevel
}
class PhLevel <<value object>> {
-value: Decimal {readOnly}
}
note right of PhLevel
Finite dimensionless value in [0, 14] for the soil model.
Equality compares the numeric value; updates create a new value.
Crop-specific thresholds belong to AgronomicRule.
end note
}
Diagnosis "1" *-- "0..1" TerrainData : analyzed
TerrainData "1" *-- "1" PhLevel : pH
interfacesLayer -[hidden]down-> applicationLayer
applicationLayer -[hidden]down-> domainLayer
domainLayer -[hidden]down-> infrastructureLayer
@enduml
